      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْنٌ خَرَّارَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A sounding</i> [i. e. <i>murmuring</i> or
<i>gurgling</i>] <i>spring</i> or <i>source:</i> (S:) or <i>a running
spring</i> or <i>source:</i> so called because of the sound
of its water: (IAar:) or <i>a spring,</i> or <i>source,
welling forth abundantly.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَارٌّ</span>.

